  "job_B9.5.5_20251003_115024": {
    "chunk_text": "& \u00fea \u00fea hi genoh fulle w\u00e6ron, ne cw\u00e6\u00f0 to heom: he willa\u00f0 ge nu leng \u00feeofian ne yfel don, ac & \u00fea het he heora \u00e6ghwylcum gesomnian his byr\u00feene wyrta. & \u00fea w\u00e6s swa geworden, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea \u00fee \u00feider comon to \u00feam wyrtgearde, to \u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00fe\u00e6r Eac swylce on sume tide to him geneal\u00e6hton sume \u00e6l\u00feeodige men & his mildheortnesse b\u00e6don & \u00fea \u00fea hi hine hr\u00e6gles b\u00e6don, swigende gehyrde heora word se drihtnes wer, & he \u00e6nne of his & \u00fea \u00fea se \u00feegn eode & \u00fe\u00e6t treow sohte & funde, swa swa him beboden w\u00e6s, & \u00fe\u00e6t hr\u00e6gl \u00dea hi \u00feas hr\u00e6gl gesawon, hi gecneowon, \u00fe\u00e6t hi hi \u00e6r gehyddon, & wurdon af\u00e6rede mid Hit gelamp eac on o\u00fere tid, \u00fe\u00e6t sum man w\u00e6s hine sylfne bef\u00e6stende to his gebedum & him & he \u00fea se Godes wer \u00fea ane \u00feancfullice onfeng & \u00feone ylcan cniht l\u00e6rde & cw\u00e6\u00f0: \u00feis me is on Beo \u00feu for\u00feon w\u00e6r, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu ne sy gesl\u00e6gen fram \u00fe\u00e6re n\u00e6dran, gif \u00feu \u00fea spyrtan unw\u00e6rlice For \u00f0am wordum \u00fea se cniht swi\u00f0e scamiende w\u00e6s gefeonde, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feone dea\u00f0 ge\u00feigde, ac he & \u00fea w\u00e6s eft cyrrende to \u00fe\u00e6re spyrtan & w\u00e6rlice hawode & geseah, \u00fe\u00e6t seo n\u00e6dre \u00fe\u00e6r in w\u00e6s, Witodlice \u00fea \u00fea se Godes man unwi\u00f0meted",
